sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Ingredient as Ingredient
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Ingredient: updateDetails(name, unit, category)
    Note over Ingredient: Policies: ingredientRead, ingredientWrite, ingredientExecute
    Note over Ingredient: Guards (2)
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: mutate.name
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: mutate.unit
    Ingredient->>Ingredient: mutate.category
    Ingredient->>EventBus: emit IngredientDetailsUpdated on ingredient.details_updated
    Ingredient-->>-Client: void